                                                "sense_id": "d453e295-6578-33d0-9e52-f4d99fad6da9",
                                                "text": "A Saturday extra loaded with holiday-makers returning to the Midlands leaves Llandudno Junction on June 11, 1960, behind Stanier 2-6-0 No. 42976."
                                            }
